{"repositoryId":974885654,"availability":"available","full":"EvolvingLMMs-Lab/Aero-1","name":"Aero-1","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":79,"forks":6,"created":"2025-04-29T13:02:00Z","updated":"2025-05-04T03:00:17Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/lmms-lab/Aero-1-Audio-Demo","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:51.703Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:51.703Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:51.703Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T17:01:51.703Z","stars":79,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Github | Playground | Models | Evaluation Results | Cookbook","Aero-1-Audio is a compact yet powerful audio-language model designed for a wide range of audio tasks, including automatic speech recognition (ASR), audio understanding, and instruction following. It is part of the Aero-1 series, the first generation of lightweight multimodal models developed by LMMs-Lab, with future expansions planned across additional modalities."],"features":["Built upon Qwen-2.5-1.5B, Aero-1-Audio achieves competitive performance on multiple audio benchmarks while maintaining exceptional parameter efficiency. It performs on par with or even surpasses larger models such as…","Trained in just one day on 16 H100 GPUs using 50K hours of high-quality, filtered audio data, Aero-1-Audio demonstrates that audio model training can be highly sample-efficient when using curated datasets.","Aero-1-Audio handles continuous audio inputs of up to 15 minutes without splitting, delivering accurate ASR and understanding—a capability that remains challenging for many existing models."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/EvolvingLMMs-Lab/Aero-1/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7d83ac257521fe70ca3edbb6a58dce4beffb28499abd31656544d0052160fdb2","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T17:01:51.823Z"},"overview